```mermaid
flowchart TD
    start([Début]) --> acquisition[Acquisition du bien]
    acquisition --> generation[Generation code inventaire]
    generation --> creation[Creation du bien en base]
    creation --> decision{Affectation immediate?}

    decision -->|Oui| affectation[Affectation à un service]
    decision -->|Non| stock[Mise en stock]

    stock --> decision2{Maintenance demandee?}
    affectation --> decision2

    decision2 -->|Oui| maintenance[Planification maintenance]
    decision2 -->|Non| decision3{Reforme demandee?}

    maintenance --> debut[Demarrage maintenance]
    debut --> fin[Cloture maintenance]
    fin --> decision3

    decision3 -->|Oui| reforme[Mise en reforme]
    decision3 -->|Non| decision4{Transfert?}

    reforme --> decision5{Cession?}
    decision5 -->|Oui| cession[Cession validee]
    decision5 -->|Non| archive[Archivage]
    cession --> archive

    decision4 -->|Oui| transfert[Transfert vers autre service]
    decision4 -->|Non| decision2

    transfert --> decision2

    archive --> end([Fin])

    style acquisition fill:#e1f5e1
    style creation fill:#e1f5e1
    style affectation fill:#fff4e1
    style maintenance fill:#ffe1e1
    style reforme fill:#ffe1e1
    style cession fill:#ffe1e1
    style archive fill:#e1e1f5
```
